  m_Name: Carta_UsinaTermica
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Usina T\xE9rmica"
  _titleEn: Thermal Power Plant
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Usinas termel\xE9tricas queimam g\xE1s, carv\xE3o ou \xF3leo e podem
    ser ligadas a qualquer hora, o que garante energia quando outras fontes falham."
  _summaryEn: Thermal power plants burn gas, coal or oil and can be switched on at
    any time, securing power when other sources fail.
  _realWorld: "Na crise h\xEDdrica de 2020 e 2021, com os reservat\xF3rios das hidrel\xE9tricas
    baixos, o Brasil acionou as termel\xE9tricas e criou uma bandeira tarif\xE1ria
    de escassez h\xEDdrica na conta de luz."
  _realWorldEn: During the 2020 and 2021 water crisis, with hydropower reservoirs
    low, Brazil switched on its thermal plants and created a water scarcity surcharge
    on electricity bills.
  _tradeOffs: "T\xE9rmicas emitem gases de efeito estufa e poluem o ar local, e a
    energia delas \xE9 cara."
  _tradeOffsEn: Thermal plants emit greenhouse gases and pollute local air, and their
    electricity is expensive.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Crise h\xEDdrica no Brasil em 2020 a 2021 (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crise_h%C3%ADdrica_no_Brasil_em_2020%E2%80%932021
